WEB SOURCE (the specification)
  web/src/components/ui/Pagination.tsx — a CONTROLLED table pagination control (parent owns
  page/pageSize, child emits onPageChange/onPageSizeChange). Render:
    <nav aria-label=t('a11y.pagination','Pagination') flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between>
      <div> "Showing {start}–{end} of {total}" [aria-live polite]
            {onPageSizeChange && <select aria-label=t('pagination.pageSize','Rows per page')>
                                   option t('pagination.perPage','{{count}} / page')> }
      <div> [First page]  [Previous page]  "{page} / {totalPages}" [aria-current,
            aria-label t('pagination.currentPage','Page {{page}} of {{total}}')]
            [Next page]  [Last page] </div>
    </nav>
  totalPages = max(1, ceil(total/pageSize)) · start = (page-1)*pageSize+1 (shown 0 when total==0) ·
  end = min(page*pageSize, total) · prev/first disabled page<=1 · next/last disabled page>=totalPages.
  i18next interpolation (escapeValue:false, no number formatter) ⇒ numbers stringify with NO
  grouping separator. Data sources: useTranslation only (no hooks, no HTTP).

